Version 1 Step 1 - 4700uF charge; ASSUMED source, not measured ST25DV data
* V_EH model: assumed 3.3 V open-circuit and 1 kohm series resistance
* U1 disabled: 100 kohm proxy for Pololu EN pull-up current (~10 uA/V)
* No load, supercapacitor leakage, RF interruption, or converter dynamics
VVEH SRC 0 DC 3.3
RSRC SRC VSTORE 1k
C1 VSTORE 0 10n
CSTORE VSTORE 0 4700u IC=0
ROFF VSTORE 0 100k
.tran 0 60 0 0.02 UIC
.meas tran T_3V WHEN V(VSTORE)=3.0 RISE=1
.meas tran T_3P1V WHEN V(VSTORE)=3.1 RISE=1
.meas tran V_10S FIND V(VSTORE) AT=10
.meas tran V_60S FIND V(VSTORE) AT=60
.save V(VSTORE) I(VVEH)
.end
